{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉と遊びました。\nお買い物して、服を見てご飯を食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレーパンマン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN42Y5300GR37NBGKX903NT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポテトサラダ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN42ZC8XPHAH1BYKGEBRFDK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でつくれるんです!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN431KHDEYRE14TMPSC1SZF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n混ぜてます。\n私は結構荒い方がすきでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デザート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN432Y26689509ESMBFVDTR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nわたしは、プリンアラモード"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りは、よねと遭遇してお喋りしました。\n幸せな1日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝ごはん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN434CFV0NBJEP8F64E7BR4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">と、シュークリームとプリン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、とっても幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやかけ見てくださいね!\nべりなーこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}